## Title: Shield Overlay
## Notes: /shield to move, /shield reset to default, /shield hide/show to show/hide the shield bar, /shield party to refresh party frames, 20%-200% functional shield bar, shows shield overlays in raid/player/party frames. Minimal addon for blizzard original raid/party UI.
